<h1>Promotions &amp; coupons</h1>
<div class="box"><h2>Create a discount code</h2><form method="post" action="/admin/promotions" class="form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
<div class="row2"><%- f.input('code','Code (letters/numbers)','',{required:true,maxlength:30,placeholder:'WELCOME10'}) %><%- f.input('description','Description (internal)','') %></div>
<div class="row2"><%- f.select('type','Type',[{value:'percent',label:'Percentage off'},{value:'fixed',label:'Fixed amount off (GHS)'}],'percent') %><%- f.input('value','Value (e.g. 10 for 10%, or 50 for GHS 50)','',{required:true,inputmode:'decimal'}) %></div>
<div class="row2"><%- f.input('min_spend','Minimum spend (GHS, optional)','',{inputmode:'decimal'}) %><%- f.input('max_uses','Total uses allowed (optional)','',{type:'number',min:1}) %></div>
<div class="row2"><%- f.input('starts_at','Starts (optional)','',{type:'date'}) %><%- f.input('expires_at','Expires (optional)','',{type:'date'}) %></div>
<%- f.check('once_per_customer','Each customer may use it once',true) %><%- f.check('first_order_only','First order only',false) %><button class="btn btn-gold" type="submit">Create code</button></form></div>
<div class="box"><h2>Codes</h2><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Discount</th><th>Min spend</th><th>Used</th><th>Valid</th><th>Rules</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<% coupons.forEach(c => { %><tr><td><strong><%= c.code %></strong><br><small><%= c.description %></small></td><td><%= c.type === 'percent' ? c.value + '%' : ghs(c.value) %></td><td><%= c.min_spend ? ghs(c.min_spend) : '–' %></td><td><%= c.uses %><%= c.max_uses ? ' / ' + c.max_uses : '' %></td><td><%= (c.starts_at || '').slice(0,10) %> → <%= (c.expires_at || 'no end').slice(0,10) %></td><td><%= c.first_order_only ? 'first order · ' : '' %><%= c.once_per_customer ? 'once each' : '' %></td>
<td><form method="post" action="/admin/promotions/<%= c.id %>/toggle" class="inline"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><button class="pill <%= c.active ? 'pill-ok' : 'pill-bad' %>" type="submit" style="border:0;cursor:pointer"><%= c.active ? 'Active – click to stop' : 'Off – click to start' %></button></form>
<form method="post" action="/admin/promotions/<%= c.id %>/delete" class="inline" data-confirm="Delete this code?"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><button class="link" type="submit">Delete</button></form></td></tr><% }) %>
<% if (!coupons.length) { %><tr><td colspan="7">No codes yet.</td></tr><% } %></tbody></table></div>
<div class="box"><h2>Referral codes</h2><p>Every registered customer has a referral code. A friend using it on their first order gets <%= referralPct %>% off (change in <a href="/admin/settings">Settings</a>; set 0 to switch off).</p>
<table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Customer</th><th>Code</th><th>Sign-ups</th><th>Paid orders</th></tr></thead><tbody><% referrals.forEach(r => { %><tr><td><%= r.name %></td><td><%= r.referral_code %></td><td><%= r.signups %></td><td><%= r.paid_orders %></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div>
<div class="box"><h2>Gift bundles &amp; offers</h2><p>Make a bundle by adding a product in the “Gift Sets &amp; Bundles” category with its own price and stock. Reduced prices: set a “discount price” on a size. Both appear on the Offers page.</p></div>
